      "Which jobs suited you best, and why?",
      "Does your job involve driving, machinery or safety-critical tasks?",
      "Is your current job at the level of your qualifications and ability?",
      "Have you taken time off sick for stress, anxiety or depression? When?",
      "If you have been self-employed, how did you manage tax, invoices and records?",
