      "Do they have tics: repeated movements or noises they find hard to stop?",
      "Do they have very strong interests, fixed routines, or difficulty understanding other people's feelings or jokes?",
      "Do they have thoughts they cannot get rid of, or things they must do over and over?",
      "(Teenagers) Have you had spells of feeling unusually high or full of energy, needing much less sleep?",
